# A worked example of companies working together (2026-09-30): the hammer waits until a
# neighbour has the enemy engaged and the enemy has fired, then goes in with the bayonet
# while they reload. Pair it with Anvil. v2: Brawler type, charges on the enemy's reload.
drill "Hammer"
about "Waits short of the fight until a neighbour has the enemy engaged and the enemy has emptied his rifles, then rushes in with the bayonet while they reload. Meets a charge with a charge and runs down a breaking enemy."
type Brawler
dials aggression 0.85 discipline 0.60 cohesion 0.60 cover 0.40 patience 0.30 nerve 0.85

sergeant:
  when enemy breaking or enemy broken                          -> charge
  when enemy charging and enemy within 30                      -> charge
  # the enemy is locked in a fight with another company of ours: hit it from the side
  when enemy engaged elsewhere and enemy within 50             -> charge; form open
  # they have just fired and are blind in their own smoke: go in through it
  when smoke between us and enemy within 50                    -> charge; form open
  when neighbour engaged and enemy reloading and enemy within 60 -> charge; form open
  when enemy reloading and enemy within 35                     -> charge; form open
  when neighbour falling back and enemy within 40              -> charge
  when enemy within 60                                         -> hold; find cover; hold fire
  when time over 150s                                          -> charge
  otherwise                                                    -> advance slow; form open; hold fire

man:
  when enemy within 12                                         -> charge
  when charging                                                -> charge
  otherwise                                                    -> follow sergeant
